### **Feature Announcement Copy**

We are pleased to introduce the **Table-to-Graph Visualization journey** for **DD Format (Section C - Part 1 and Part 2)**, designed to transform complex tabular data into dynamic, user-interactive insights.

Previously, users reviewed data solely through static tables. Identifying visual trends, comparing key metrics, or analyzing specific row and column relationships required manual effort and extra time, making data synthesis less intuitive.

Here comes the best-in-class journey: table data can now be converted instantly into clean, animated graphical representations—including **Pie, Line, and Bar charts**—directly within the screen interface.

This functionality has been implemented across **DD Format Section C (Part 1 and Part 2)**, empowering users with customizable options to select exact rows and columns to generate personalized visual charts tailored to their review needs.

The visualization tool has been enriched with intuitive features such as vibrant, high-contrast color schemes, smooth chart transitions, animated data rendering, and quick toggling between chart types, enabling faster data comprehension and effortless comparison.

Overall, this enhancement delivers a more engaging, efficient, and insight-driven data review experience, helping users grasp critical metrics at a glance.

